1. NODE.JS KYA HAI?
-------------------
Node.js ek JavaScript runtime environment hai jo JavaScript ko browser ke bahar run karta hai.

Node.js Chrome ke V8 JavaScript engine par built hai.

Main components:
- V8 → JavaScript execute karta hai
- libuv → Event Loop aur asynchronous I/O ko support karta hai
- C/C++ → Node.js ke core/native features ko support karta hai

Basic flow:

JavaScript Code
      ↓
   Node.js
      ↓
      V8
      ↓
JavaScript Execute


