6. CALL STACK
-------------
Call Stack JavaScript ke functions ko execute/manage karta hai.

Example:

function one() {
    two();
}

function two() {
    console.log("Hello");
}

one();

Execution:

one()
 ↓
two()
 ↓
console.log()
 ↓
two() remove
 ↓
one() remove

Call Stack LIFO principle follow karta hai:
Last In, First Out.


7. SYNCHRONOUS CODE
-------------------
Example:

console.log("A");
console.log("B");
console.log("C");

Output:

A
B
C

Code line-by-line execute hota hai.


8. ASYNCHRONOUS CODE
--------------------
Example:

console.log("A");

setTimeout(() => {
    console.log("B");
}, 2000);

console.log("C");

Output:

A
C
B

Node.js timer ke liye main thread ko block nahi karta.


