10. NON-BLOCKING I/O
--------------------
Node.js ka major feature non-blocking I/O hai.

Example:

const fs = require("fs");

fs.readFile("data.txt", "utf8", (err, data) => {
    console.log("File Read");
});

console.log("Hello");

Output:

Hello
File Read

Node.js file read hone ka wait karke main thread ko block nahi karta.


11. libuv
---------
libuv Node.js architecture ka important library/component hai.

Main responsibilities:
- Event Loop
- Asynchronous I/O support
- Thread Pool
- Timers
- File-system related async operations
- Networking support

Remember:

V8   → JavaScript execute
libuv → Async I/O + Event Loop infrastructure


12. THREAD POOL
--------------
libuv ke through kuch operations background thread pool par execute ho sakte hain.

Thread Pool ka simplified model:

                 Node.js
                    │
                Main Thread
                    │
                Event Loop
                    │
              Async Operation
                    │
                    ▼
               Thread Pool
              ┌────┼────┐
              ▼    ▼    ▼
             T1   T2   T3 ...

Thread pool se commonly associated operations:
- File system operations
- Some crypto operations
- Certain DNS operations

Important:
Har asynchronous operation thread pool mein nahi jaata.
Network I/O ke liye OS-level asynchronous mechanisms bhi use hote hain.


13. EVENT LOOP + THREAD POOL
----------------------------
Dono ko confuse mat karna.

Event Loop:
Callback ko coordinate/process karne mein help karta hai.

Thread Pool:
Kuch background operations perform karta hai.

Simple:

Event Loop → Callback handling
Thread Pool → Certain background work


14. IMPORTANT EXAMPLE
---------------------
const fs = require("fs");

console.log("Start");

fs.readFile("data.txt", "utf8", (err, data) => {
    console.log("File Read");
});

console.log("End");

Output:

Start
End
File Read

Execution:

1. "Start" execute
2. fs.readFile() async operation start
3. Node.js wait nahi karta
4. "End" execute
5. File read complete hoti hai
6. Callback execution ke liye schedule hota hai
7. Event Loop callback ko execute karwata hai
8. "File Read" print hota hai


